   "stem": {
      "text": "Let \\( f \\) be the function that satisfies \\( f'(x) = x\\left(f(x)\\right)^{2} \\), with \\( f(-1) = 1 \\). Find the second-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( f \\) about \\( x = -1 \\)."
